# Monologg (monologg/)
monologg/**/node_modules/
monologg/**/dist/
monologg/apps/web/dist-designsystem/
monologg/apps/web/dist-standalone/
monologg/**/.vite/
monologg/**/coverage/
monologg/apps/api/uploads/
